SUMMARY:The Shop Small Stop
DESCRIPTION:Need a break from the holiday hustle? 🛍️\nBetween shopping downtown & hitting up Lackawanna Station\, duck into RecRoom for a little peace\, coffee\, and Wi-Fi. Whether you want to get some work done\, sit with a book\, or just recharge\, our doors are open all weekend – free to drop in\, no membership or day pass needed. 🫶 \n📅 Saturday\, November 28 & Sunday\, November 29\n🕙 11 AM-5 PM\n📍 RecRoom at Lackawanna Station\n☕ Complimentary coffee\, tea & hot chocolate\n💻 Free Wi-Fi\n🛋️ Cozy places to sit and relax – or put your head down and knock out your To Do list\n❤️ Good vibes and a warm welcome \nBring your laptop\, your shopping bags\, or just yourself. We’d love to see you! 🫶 \nRSVP: Sign up with below for fast check in at the door. You’ll be added to our email list and will have the chance to win a free day pass\, too! \nPLUS: A Small Business Sat + Sun special – stay tuned! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
