SUMMARY:It's a Wonderful Life - The Radio Play
DESCRIPTION:Be part of a 20-year holiday tradition!\nJoin returning actors and crew as they pass the torch to newcomers and transport audiences back to a 1940s studio for a radio-play adaptation of the classic Christmas film.\nThis isn’t just a show to round out our year—it’s a timeless staple\, one that our audience returns to again and again at the most magical time of year.\nWhether it’s your first time at the show or you’ve been attending for years\, there’s no better way to ring in the holiday season than with The Theater Project.\nBring friends and family\, take refuge from the winter cold in the warmth of the Oakes Center Theater\, and join us as we share time-honored tradition with the NJ community. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/its-a-wonderful-life-the-radio-play/2026-11-28/
LOCATION:The Oakes Center\, 120 Morris Ave\, Summit NJ\, 120 Morris Ave\, Summit\, 07901\, United States
CATEGORIES:Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IAWL-evergreen-250x250-2.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="The Theater Project":MAILTO:garyglor@thetheaterproject.org
