SUMMARY:DJ Rafe Gomez presents Danceteria REWIND at Porta
DESCRIPTION:DJ Rafe Gomez\, host of the popular Twitch channel Danceteria REWIND\, will present an immersive sonic and visual re-creation of the famed NYC nightclub Danceteria at Porta in Montclair.  The free event\, which will be the tri-state area’s official debut of Rafe’s multimedia performance\, will take place on Saturday\, 11/28\, 499 Bloomfield Avenue\, from 9pm to 1am. \nDanceteria was a New York hotspot from 1979 to 1986.  It was famous for embracing iconic art (Keith Haring worked at the club as a waiter\, Kenny Scharf was a member of the performance troupe\, and Jean-Michel Basquiat painted murals)\, video\, fashion\, and music.  It’s also where LL Cool J\, the Beastie Boys\, RuPaul\, Debi Mazar\, and Madonna got their starts. \nThis year\, Danceteria has been trending:  Madonna released a #1 hit single titled “Danceteria” that chronicled her adventures there\, and the UK synth duo Soft Cell’s new album “Danceteria” explores the early 80s downtown NYC scene that inspired their musical journey. \nGomez’s Twitch show\, which launched in 2023 and streams weekly on Thursday nights\, has over 60\,000 global followers.  Using playlists of Danceteria’s original DJs\, he serves up a beat-matched flow that replicates the club’s distinctive multi-genre mix of rap\, electro\, EDM\, 70s funk\, Afrobeat\, Latin boogaloo\, 60s garage rock and bubblegum\, punk\, reggae\, new wave\, disco\, and more. \nAlong with attracting international followers to his Twitch mix\, Gomez has also garnered attention from the overseas art world.  He’s currently curating soundtracks for exhibitions in Italy and Japan that will showcase works by the superstar artists who were part of the Danceteria community. \n“Danceteria was a five-floor supermarket of style where gays\, straights\, artists\, goths\, skinheads\, lost uptowners\, curious bridge and tunnel kids\, weirdos from outer space\, drag queens\, and world-changing creatives of all kinds got together\,” says Gomez.  ”For everyone who was lucky enough to visit the club\, my Porta gig will bring back great memories.  And for those who never had the chance to check it out\, prepare for a fantastic trip.” \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/rafe-gomez-presents-danceteria-rewind/
LOCATION:Porta Montclair\, 499 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Porta-flyer-1.png
END:VEVENT
