SUMMARY:DETROIT JAZZ Documentary Screening at Montclair State University FREE 6PM W/FILMMAKERS
DESCRIPTION:Montclair State University’s College of Communications Film Forum and the Music Department present: \nA Film Screening of Emerita Professor Roberta Friedman’s the new feature documentary: \nThe Best of the Best: Jazz from Detroit\nwith Q&A w/Filmmakers Dan Loewenthal\, Roberta Friedman\, and writer Stryker \nMonday Night November 30th\, 6PM-8:45PM. at College of Communication Building’s Presentation Hall. \nSynopsis: \nThe Best of the Best: Jazz from Detroit chronicles the defining impact of Detroit’s innovative and influential jazz legacy and the iconic city that produced it. Inspired by Mark Stryker’s 2019 book\, Jazz from Detroit\, the 90-minute documentary weaves a compelling historical and cultural tapestry through the 20th and 21st centuries. Set within Detroit’s dramatic rise and fall as an industrial power and the struggles and triumphs of its creative and resilient African American community\, the film connects the dots between the city’s history and Black musical excellence. \nWebsite: https://www.jazzfromdetroitfilm.com/ (See Trailer here. ) \nDirections:\nPark in the Red Hawk deck\, and walk to the center of campus – located directly across from the library is the CCOM building and inside the door on the left is the Presentation Hall. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/detroit-jazz-documentary-screening-at-montclair-state-university-free-6pm-w-filmmakers/
LOCATION:Montclair State University Presentation Hall College of Communications and Media\, 1 Normal Ave\, Montclair\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:Film
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/FilmForum_BestOfTheBest_Poster_2700x4050-1-scaled.jpg
