SUMMARY:Table Talk: Live Negotiation Course for High Schoolers (Online\, Winter Cohort)
DESCRIPTION:Table Talk is a live online negotiation course for high schoolers\, taught by Namit Satara\, a UChicago Booth MBA who helped teach negotiation there to 200+ grad students alongside renowned professors. Students meet for 7 live classes on Zoom in small groups of 12. Every class opens in breakout rooms with a real negotiation\, like agreeing on the price of a car\, and students leave able to ask for a better offer\, price or deadline on their own. \nWinter cohorts (grades 9 to 12\, online on Zoom)\, 7 weekly classes:\n– Tuesdays 7:00 to 8:30 pm ET\, starting Dec 1\, 2026 (Dec 1\, 8\, 15\, then Jan 5\, 12\, 19\, 26)\n– Wednesdays 8:30 to 10:00 pm ET\, starting Dec 2\, 2026 \nPrice: $1\,200\, early-bird $1\,000 through Nov 15. Enrollment closes Nov 30. Full refund after the first class if it’s not a fit. \nLearn more and enroll: https://tabletalknegotiation.com\nQuestions: namit@tabletalknegotiation.com\, (201) 916-9300 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
