SUMMARY:The Precipice
DESCRIPTION:Our Fall Cultural Arts season concludes with two performances of The Precipice\, written by Montclair’s own songwriter\, storyteller\, and singer Miranda Ferriss Jones. Jones will take the stage with fellow Montclair resident and Tony Award-winning Broadway star Laura Benanti\, alongside an exciting ensemble of theatrical talent. Created by Ferris Jones\, The Precipice is an original musical exploring sisterhood\, identity\, and the wildness we carry within us.\n$45 MEMBER ADMISSION | $50 GENERAL ADMISSION \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
