SUMMARY:Santa at Van Vleck
DESCRIPTION:Everyone’s favorite jolly man is returning to Van Vleck House for family photos and fun again this December! Families can enjoy snacks\, activities and fabulous holiday photos with New Moon Photography during their timed visit with Old Saint Nick. Sensory-friendly sessions are available each date.\nAppointment times are mandatory. This is not a drop-in event.\nFriday\, Dec. 4\, Saturday\, Dec. 5 & Sunday\, Dec. 6. See website for times. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
