SUMMARY:Chamber Opera Performance: "L'enfant et les Sortilèges"
DESCRIPTION:Maurice Ravel’s L’enfant et les sortilèges is a wildly imaginative fantasy opera where a single child’s tantrum sets an entire enchanted world into motion. In a flash of frustration\, the ordinary becomes extraordinary—walls start to whisper\, teacups burst into song\, animals argue back\, and the child’s room transforms into a living\, breathing world of magic and mischief. \nAs this fantastical realm awakens\, the child is swept into a dazzling swirl of musical surprises and unexpected voices\, where every object has something to say and nothing is quite as it seems. With Ravel’s shimmering\, kaleidoscopic score at its heart\, this enchanting opera is a playful journey through wonder\, chaos\, and the power of imagination to transform everything it touches. \n(Sung in French with English surtitles ~ runtime: approx 1 hour) \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/chamber-opera-performance-lenfant-et-les-sortileges/
LOCATION:Alexander Kasser Theater\, Montclair State University\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
